## 8. Change record minimum content (other triggers)

Every change under section 4 (other than a plain admission under T1 and a T8b pull request) records at least: change ID and trigger number; description; impact assessment (affected requirements, risks, surfaces, contexts and repositories); the confirmatory subset chosen and any written reduction; test results with evidence and SHA-256; the new baseline revision of {{doc_id_06}}; approval by the {{role_approver}} before deployment (or the emergency justification and the retrospective approval date); effective date.
